Subject: Urgent: UAE-authorized representative for two PBK PCT filings - =
proposal by 29 October Dear Patent Team, I urgently seek a =
UAE-authorized patent representative in Dubai to arrange and carry out =
two international PCT filings for PBK ENGINEERING INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY =
RIGHTS MANAGEMENT - FZCO, a Dubai UAE company, trade licence No. 38769. =
Please route this inquiry to the practitioner responsible for =
international patent filings. I am Mikhail Dmitrievich Kozin (Mikhail =
Kozin in the patent records), the sole inventor and PBK's sole =
shareholder and General Manager. I am a Russian citizen principally =
resident in Sharjah, hold an Emirates ID and have Spanish permanent =
residence. Please identify any conflict-check or onboarding documents =
you require. Immediate scope: two PCT international applications, not =
merely UAE national-phase entries: * Group 2: AI Pricing and Retail =
Intelligence Platform, based on US provisional applications #1, #2, #8 =
and #9. Earliest working priority date: December 11, 2025; priority =
control deadline: December 11, 2026. Requested filing date: November 28, =
2026. If weekend scheduling affects this date, please propose an earlier =
working-day filing. * Group 1: Modular Cabinet Platform, based on US =
provisional applications #3-7, involving mechanical, electronic and =
software-controlled retail equipment. Earliest working priority date: =
December 23, 2025; priority control deadline: December 23, 2026. =
Requested filing date: December 3, 2026. Please independently verify the =
dates and priority entitlement from the official records. PBK is the =
intended sole applicant. PPA #10 is outside these two applications. =
Subsequent project stages remain planned, but will be discussed after =
these filings; separate simultaneous US or Russian national applications =
are not part of the immediate request. Available materials include the =
filed provisional specifications and drawings, USPTO receipts and =
indexes, supplementary explanations, and an editable English draft for =
Group 1 with claims and a 22-sheet drawing PDF prepared by former US =
counsel. Group 2 needs full drafting. These are working materials, not =
confirmation that nonprovisional applications have already been filed. =
The documents can be supplied through an agreed secure channel after =
conflict clearance and confirmation of confidentiality covering both PBK =
and me. Please quote separately for: 1. UAE representation and actual =
filing, coordinating with US drafting counsel whom we are considering =
but have not yet engaged: final filing/formality checks, powers of =
attorney, priority documents, ePCT submission, fee payment, filing =
confirmations, forwarding notices and filing corrections. Please state =
how much advance time you need to receive the final package. 2. Full =
preparation and filing, if your team can undertake both groups, reusing =
suitable existing work and coordinating any necessary specialists. I =
require an end-to-end filing service and will not personally complete =
ePCT forms or submit applications. I will provide technical =
explanations, approve the agreed approach and sign documents genuinely =
requiring my signature. Please provide: * The name, firm, UAE =
registration number and evidence of authorization of the specific agent =
who would act for PBK before WIPO/RO/IB, or explain another competent =
route. Please confirm actual international-filing eligibility for this =
UAE applicant, not only UAE national-phase experience. * The responsible =
practitioner's technical experience and approximate number of similar =
mechanical/electronic/software and PCT projects. * A fixed professional =
fee for each application and option, with official filing/search fees, =
drawings, translations, VAT and other expenses itemized separately. =
Identify the proposed competent search authority and any estimates or =
exclusions. * A dated preparation, review and filing schedule, a payment =
schedule linked to deliverables, and a draft engagement agreement before =
any deposit. * Clear allocation of responsibility between drafting =
counsel and your filing agent, including deadline monitoring, notices =
and free correction of errors attributable to the service providers. * =
The documents required from PBK and me, including any powers of =
attorney, ownership confirmations and current manager/registration =
evidence. My discussions and comments are in Russian. Please state =
whether you can provide Russian-language support and include the =
required written translations in the fixed fee for the full-service =
option. The proposed filing language is English. Completion of the =
filing stage must include the complete filed documents, official =
international application numbers and filing dates, priority particulars =
and fee-payment confirmations. Please also identify and price support =
through the international search report and written opinion. Please =
acknowledge availability urgently and, if possible, provide the =
proposal, named authorized representative, draft agreement, full cost =
breakdown and schedule by October 29, 2026. If further material is =
needed to quote, please send one consolidated list immediately. Any =
chargeable preliminary assessment must first be quoted and approved in =
writing. This is an urgent request for a proposal, not acceptance of an =
engagement, authorization for paid work or an instruction to file =
without subsequent agreement. Payments will be made only against =
official organizational invoices; additional charges require prior =
written approval. Kind regards, Mikhail Kozin PBK ENGINEERING =
